    {
      "key_point_id": "kp_identity",
      "statement": "Correct objects, chemical bookkeeping and valid evidence.",
      "expected": "Inspect species_registry, every input/geometry mapping and real raw log. Verify stoichiometry, charge/multiplicity, method/state, stationarity or constrained label, and consistent thermochemistry. The precursor is the tetrasubstituted O-TMS enol ether made from 50: transform C6–C47 to double, C47=O52 to single, replace H7 on C6 by an O52–SiMe3 group; retain all other mapped stereocentres. It is neutral singlet C23H38O3Si. Reprotonate C6 from the two faces using racemic camphorsulfonic acid (CSA), not a bare proton. Model both acid enantiomers in an achiral medium or demonstrate the appropriate symmetry equivalence. Stage 1: HMDS/TMSI in DCM at 23°C. Stage 2: CSA in THF/MeOH at 23°C; SI pp20–21 specifies 6/0.60 mL (10:1), whereas main Scheme5 says 1:1. Use a THF continuum plus one explicit MeOH in every cluster for the primary local model and a MeOH-continuum matched sensitivity; neither is an exact mixed-solvent model. Use 296.15 K and 1 M. Keep CSA− and the protonated silyl ether in the same neutral cluster; downstream desilylation is outside the required path segment.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "source_1",
        "source_2",
        "upgrade_design"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_point_id": "kp_facial_paths",
      "statement": "Two faces under racemic CSA with symmetry-supported equivalence allowed through explicit records.",
      "expected": "Two faces under racemic CSA with symmetry-supported equivalence allowed through explicit records. Recompute quantities from identified raw jobs and evidence files. Check all required named matrix cells; prose or a legacy scalar cannot replace this endpoint. A scientific ambiguity is valid only after the relevant controls exist. Non-saddle/collapse alternatives require actual profiles and both endpoints, not failed optimization. A same-basin comparison may omit nonexistent independent numeric operands only after separate complete searches, mapped identity and stationarity demonstrate collapse; this never excuses a missing control. New numerical reference and tolerances are pending; never choose a preferred value or broaden a legacy tolerance to excuse wrong identity.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "source_1",
